title: Settings brought from GitHub that list extensions this computer lacks, or set a command for commit messages, ask first, naming each version and whether its publisher is verified, and nothing is installed or run when the answer is no
folders: rust-small
github: settings-new-extensions.json
openvsx: on
expect-log: asking: Run this command for commit messages\? \(evil-command --steal\)
expect-log: asking: Install the extensions kept on GitHub\? \(qa-tools\.bru-lite@1\.2\.0  verified publisher \| qa-tools\.lint-plus@3\.0\.1  NOT verified\)
expect-log: the command for commit messages from GitHub is not used
expect-log: the extensions GitHub lists are not installed
forbid-log: installing qa-tools
forbid-log: installed qa-tools
expect-file: ../data/prefs.json :: "status": false
expect-file: ../data/github.json :: "declined": \[\s*"qa-tools\.bru-lite",\s*"qa-tools\.lint-plus"\s*\]
absent-file: ../data/commit.json
absent-file: ../data/extensions/qa-tools.bru-lite-1.2.0
absent-file: ../data/extensions/qa-tools.lint-plus-3.0.1

wait 2500
account signin
wait 5000
mark asked-command
wait 600
answer Keep mine
wait 2000
mark asked-install
wait 600
answer Not now
wait 6000
mark after
wait 600
quit
